* Remaining before closing
- verify:bricscad-automation:macos cannot validate the automation path on
  thalassa: the job does not set ALFE_ENABLE_MACOS_AUTOMATION and the runner
  has no Accessibility grant ("UI elements enabled -> false"), so alfe
  refuses with exit 69 as designed. Needs a session with the grant.
- A manual Control-C check (interactive; CI cannot send it).
- The SCHME CI consumers (from alfe-owned-cad-termination-after-recorded-results).
